# sdist coverage for the vendored CrossCommitVuln QA corpus + its CC BY 4.0
# NOTICE. setuptools does not reliably fold [tool.setuptools.package-data]
# into the sdist without an explicit MANIFEST rule, and the sdist carrying
# this data is a release gate (design §4.2).
recursive-include src/pydocs_eval/datasets/data/crosscommitvuln *.jsonl NOTICE
# The eval suite's own changelog travels with the sdist; setuptools does not
# pick up CHANGELOG.md on its own.
include CHANGELOG.md
# setuptools' default sdist globs add top-level tests/test_*.py; the test
# suite is not part of the published distribution.
prune tests
